---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../../components/SectionLabel.astro';
import site from '../../data/site.json';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — SHELLCAT"
  description="How SHELLCAT collects, uses and protects enquiry data in line with India's DPDP principles."
  currentPath="/legal/privacy-policy"
>
  <section class="border-b border-border bg-shellcat-grid py-14 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionLabel file="privacy-policy.txt" />
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-mist">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">
        Last updated: <span class="placeholder-token">[INSERT EFFECTIVE DATE]</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-14 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-8 px-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary sm:px-6 sm:text-base lg:px-8">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-mist">1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          This website is operated by <strong class="text-mist">{site.company}</strong>, based in {site.location}. For privacy questions or data requests, contact <span class="placeholder-token">{site.email}</span>.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-mist">2. Information we collect</h2>
        <p>
          We collect only the information you choose to submit through our contact form:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li>Name and company name</li>
          <li>Email address and phone or WhatsApp number</li>
          <li>Selected service or package, optional website URL and your message</li>
          <li>Your explicit consent confirming that SHELLCAT may contact you about your enquiry</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-mist">3. Why we use this information</h2>
        <p>
          We use your enquiry details solely to respond to your request, send an automatic email confirmation, prepare an agreed quotation or scope, and communicate regarding the services you asked about. We do not sell or rent personal data.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-mist">4. Cookies, analytics &amp; spam protection</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not set advertising or cross-site tracking cookies. Privacy-friendly analytics without cookies may be enabled only when configured (<span class="placeholder-token">[CONFIRM ANALYTICS STATUS]</span>). The contact page uses Cloudflare Turnstile to prevent automated spam submissions.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-mist">5. Data retention &amp; your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiry records are kept only for as long as needed to handle your request or active engagement: <span class="placeholder-token">{site.legal.dataRetention}</span>.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may request access, correction or deletion of your enquiry data, or withdraw consent at any time, by emailing <span class="placeholder-token">{site.email}</span>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
